</section>)}<h2>Shopify SMS QA map</h2>
<p>
Use this map as a pre-launch checklist: every row is a failure mode that shows up as a complaint, a carrier filter, or a negative margin month rather than as a dashboard alert. Assign each row a named owner before the first broadcast, and re-verify the consent and suppression rows whenever the stack changes.
</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto">
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Permission</th>
<th>Message job</th>
